  "summary": "Malicious code in @reause/electron (npm)",
  "details": "@reause/electron is a typosquat of the legitimate @vueuse/electron package (name \"reause\" vs \"vueuse\"), published under the @reause/* scoped namespace together with a sibling dependency @reause/shared. The package impersonates the VueUse electron renderer hooks library. Installers who intended to depend on @vueuse/electron may pull this package instead. The bundled code is a React port of VueUse hooks with no detectable executable payload in this version.",
